{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3091140/extras/dcd804328dd673a92bfc49dbc26f39f4.poster.avif?t=1766846965\" width=600 height=124 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3091140/extras/dcd804328dd673a92bfc49dbc26f39f4.webm?t=1766846965\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3091140/extras/dcd804328dd673a92bfc49dbc26f39f4.mp4?t=1766846965\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lootbound</strong> is a roguelike about risk, build crafting, and a party that forms dynamically during the run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each run begins alone. You progress through a linear map with branching paths, choosing rooms, risks, and rewards along the way. Companions join you mid-run, gradually forming a party. Every character influences the build just as much as the Hero.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3091140/extras/ae04e13196d7cf4acd31a05808b67366.poster.avif?t=1766846965\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3091140/extras/ae04e13196d7cf4acd31a05808b67366.webm?t=1766846965\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3091140/extras/ae04e13196d7cf4acd31a05808b67366.mp4?t=1766846965\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Party &amp; Equipment</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Companions follow the same equipment rules as the Hero \u2014 an item only works if it\u2019s equipped. Gear choices directly affect party behavior and how the build functions overall.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3091140/extras/07d262cdedd6656441d2a09454589ab7.poster.avif?t=1766846965\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3091140/extras/07d262cdedd6656441d2a09454589ab7.webm?t=1766846965\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3091140/extras/07d262cdedd6656441d2a09454589ab7.mp4?t=1766846965\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Item Auras</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Items interact with each other. Some create auras that enhance or alter nearby items of specific types. A successful combination can completely change the course of a run. A poor one can break your build entirely.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3091140/extras/0fd82f75cf09aff42e7b8bc9802b4a88.poster.avif?t=1766846965\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3091140/extras/0fd82f75cf09aff42e7b8bc9802b4a88.webm?t=1766846965\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3091140/extras/0fd82f75cf09aff42e7b8bc9802b4a88.mp4?t=1766846965\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Skills &amp; Progression</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Hero starts with a basic skill set and unlocks new abilities throughout the run via choices, risks, and rewards. You\u2019re not just getting stronger \u2014 you\u2019re shaping a distinct playstyle step by step.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3091140/extras/3efdb28f601d832ce33b8f0703e1a403.poster.avif?t=1766846965\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3091140/extras/3efdb28f601d832ce33b8f0703e1a403.webm?t=1766846965\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3091140/extras/3efdb28f601d832ce33b8f0703e1a403.mp4?t=1766846965\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Damage Types</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lootbound features multiple damage types that interact differently with enemy armor and health. This allows you to build around specific mechanics: armor penetration, attrition, armor destruction, or direct damage.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dice Rooms</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some rooms revolve around dice rolls. You choose both the reward and the difficulty. Higher risk means better loot. Bad luck? You move on \u2014 but with consequences.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Lootbound is:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tactical roguelike runs with high replayability</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A party assembled dynamically during each run</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equipment with auras and deep synergies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Builds shaped by damage types and item interactions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meaningful risk and reward through dice-based choices</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run is a new party.<br>Every build is the result of your decisions.<br>Every mistake stays with you.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3091140?t=1766846965","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3091140/43ebe0c69d8f559c9f4a24a4d64aaa687ac5e8a7/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1766846965","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3091140/cd630bb12fb40ab64aae2b4b59afddb4995b6991/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1766846965","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3091140/cd630bb12fb40ab64aae2b4b59afddb4995b6991/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1766846965","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3091140/extras/dcd804328dd673a92bfc49dbc26f39f4.poster.avif?t=1766846965\" width=600 height=124 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3091140/extras/dcd804328dd673a92bfc49dbc26f39f4.webm?t=1766846965\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3091140/extras/dcd804328dd673a92bfc49dbc26f39f4.mp4?t=1766846965\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lootbound</strong> is a roguelike about risk, build crafting, and a party that forms dynamically during the run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each run begins alone. You progress through a linear map with branching paths, choosing rooms, risks, and rewards along the way. Companions join you mid-run, gradually forming a party. Every character influences the build just as much as the Hero.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3091140/extras/ae04e13196d7cf4acd31a05808b67366.poster.avif?t=1766846965\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3091140/extras/ae04e13196d7cf4acd31a05808b67366.webm?t=1766846965\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3091140/extras/ae04e13196d7cf4acd31a05808b67366.mp4?t=1766846965\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Party &amp; Equipment</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Companions follow the same equipment rules as the Hero \u2014 an item only works if it\u2019s equipped. Gear choices directly affect party behavior and how the build functions overall.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3091140/extras/07d262cdedd6656441d2a09454589ab7.poster.avif?t=1766846965\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3091140/extras/07d262cdedd6656441d2a09454589ab7.webm?t=1766846965\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3091140/extras/07d262cdedd6656441d2a09454589ab7.mp4?t=1766846965\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Item Auras</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Items interact with each other. Some create auras that enhance or alter nearby items of specific types. A successful combination can completely change the course of a run. A poor one can break your build entirely.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3091140/extras/0fd82f75cf09aff42e7b8bc9802b4a88.poster.avif?t=1766846965\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3091140/extras/0fd82f75cf09aff42e7b8bc9802b4a88.webm?t=1766846965\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3091140/extras/0fd82f75cf09aff42e7b8bc9802b4a88.mp4?t=1766846965\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Skills &amp; Progression</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Hero starts with a basic skill set and unlocks new abilities throughout the run via choices, risks, and rewards. You\u2019re not just getting stronger \u2014 you\u2019re shaping a distinct playstyle step by step.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3091140/extras/3efdb28f601d832ce33b8f0703e1a403.poster.avif?t=1766846965\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3091140/extras/3efdb28f601d832ce33b8f0703e1a403.webm?t=1766846965\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3091140/extras/3efdb28f601d832ce33b8f0703e1a403.mp4?t=1766846965\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Damage Types</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lootbound features multiple damage types that interact differently with enemy armor and health. This allows you to build around specific mechanics: armor penetration, attrition, armor destruction, or direct damage.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dice Rooms</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some rooms revolve around dice rolls. You choose both the reward and the difficulty. Higher risk means better loot. Bad luck? You move on \u2014 but with consequences.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Lootbound is:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tactical roguelike runs with high replayability</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A party assembled dynamically during each run</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equipment with auras and deep synergies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Builds shaped by damage types and item interactions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meaningful risk and reward through dice-based choices</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run is a new party.<br>Every build is the result of your decisions.<br>Every mistake stays with you.</p>","developers":["ArtDock"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3091140/9746399f8b8a2c2da231fd9707fe2b920fdd0675/header.jpg?t=1766846965","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3091140/2103224227/4083fe9049361421e4fa651122eade1eec1c347b/1766757135/dash_av1.mpd?t=1766761613","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3091140/2103224227/4083fe9049361421e4fa651122eade1eec1c347b/1766757135/dash_h264.mpd?t=1766761613","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3091140/2103224227/4083fe9049361421e4fa651122eade1eec1c347b/1766757135/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1766761613","id":257255524,"name":"Trailer Winter 2025","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257255524/93ab151d270fc659b2aa035b7f58957814e73c60/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1766761613"}],"name":"Lootbound","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br>